    <string name="internet_play_console">Turn on Remote Play. For rest mode, also turn on \"Stay connected to the internet\" and \"Enable turning on PS5 from network\" in the power saving settings. A PS4 can only be reached if it is the primary PS4 of your account.</string>
    <string name="internet_play_privacy_title">Your sign-in</string>
    <string name="internet_play_privacy">The sign-in stays on this device and only goes to Sony, to reach your consoles. Exported settings leave it out, and signing out deletes it.</string>
